<title>AUSTRIA: Iraq's Hiti says hopes oil exports as soon as poss.</title>
<headline>Iraq's Hiti says hopes oil exports as soon as poss.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of the Iraqi delegation to OPEC Osama al-Hiti said he hoped Iraqi oil exports would flow as soon as possible.</p>
<p>&quot;I do hope as soon as possible,&quot; he told reporters when asked when exports might flow again.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no obstacles other than the approval of the pricing formula and some very minor technicalities,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>He hoped it would be in the &quot;coming weeks&quot;</p>
</text>
